  "description": "SPSNAP v1: 36-byte little-endian header (magic SPSNAP01, u32 version=1, u32 flags, u32 pageWidthPt, u32 pageHeightPt, u32 pointCount, u32 segmentCount, u32 uncompressedBodyBytes), then the body: f32le[2*pointCount] then f32le[4*segmentCount], gzip-compressed when flags bit 0 is set. Flag bits other than bit 0 must be zero. uncompressedBodyBytes must equal 8*pointCount + 16*segmentCount and the (inflated) body length, and must not exceed 134217728. Coordinates must be finite and within [-1, width+1] x [-1, height+1]. pdfPage is the page size of the PDF the snap file is bound to.",
